 3626: //    For a point (x1,y1) inside the element and a line segment (x1,y1)-(x2,y2), find the intersection point 
 3627: //    (xIntersect,yIntersect) and the side (intersectingSide) that it intersects.
 3628: 
 3629: //    Inputs:
 3630: //    @param x1, y1: point inside the element
 3631: //    @param x2, y2: other end of the line segment
 3632: 
 3633: //    Outputs:
